          "dimension": "entries and trick counting",
          "fact": "The replacement plan preserves a feasible diamond entry and counts nine tricks correctly.",
          "explanation": "Authorized holdings are North HA43 and DKQJT9 opposite South HKQJ and D5432, with SA and CA. Cashing two heart honors preserves HJ-to-HA access even if DA wins the fourth diamond round. Four diamonds, three hearts and the two black aces total nine. S7 legally follows West's SK; the hold-up's protection is explicitly limited.",
          "quotes": [
            "Preserve HA as the essential entry: cash only HK and HQ, following with dummy's H3 and H4, and retain HJ to overtake with HA after diamonds are established.",
