          "explanation": "The authorized trick is SK-S7-S4, and South holds SA93. S3 legally ducks to West's king. The retained plan still preserves two South heart winners followed by HJ-to-HA access to North's diamonds.",
          "quotes": [
            "Duck the first spade as planned, preserving SA to interrupt defenders' communications before conceding DA.",
