          "explanation": "South holds SA9 facing the current SQ-S8-S5 after losing the first spade. S9 legally ducks while preserving SA for a third round. East's original length remains unknown; the answer conditions exhaustion on an original three-card holding. The retained diamond-entry route remains feasible.",
