        {
          "dimension": "discard and resource preservation",
          "fact": "The club discard preserves the retained plan's necessary resources.",
          "explanation": "North is void in spades and holds CT54, all five diamonds and HA43; South retains SA. Discarding C4 is legal and preserves both the diamond source and the HJ-to-HA entry arrangement. SA necessarily wins the current spade in notrump.",
          "quotes": [
            "Discard a club, preserving all five diamonds and the heart entry arrangement. South will win this spade with SA."
