          "explanation": "South is on lead with HKQJ, and North retains HA43. HK followed by HQ permits North to follow low twice and preserves HJ-to-HA access after diamond development. The authorized history shows East following S4, S5 and S6 but does not establish that East is now void.",
          "quotes": [
            "Cash two heart honors before developing diamonds, retaining HJ to lead to dummy's HA later.",
            "East followed to all three spades, but the remaining spade division is still unknown."
