          "explanation": "North holds HA4 facing South's current HQ and West's H6; South still holds HJ. Following H4 legally leaves HQ winning and HA available for North's DKQJT9 after DA is dislodged. Diamond establishment is a future phase of the retained plan.",
          "quotes": [
            "Preserve HA as the entry to established diamonds; South retains HJ to reach it."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
